		"description": "<p><em>Gadget — A freezing firearm round that restrains foes.</em></p><p><strong>2 Actions · Requires Firearm.</strong> Range 6, Blast 3, Damage: STRd8 Cold. Targets must make a STR save. On a fail, they are Restrained. On a save, they are Slowed 1 round.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt:</strong> The area remains for 1 minute, becoming Slowed Terrain.</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> Slowed you apply lasts +1 turn.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Grants the Endothermic Shell gadget item (activation, 1 scrap) and the \"Endothermic Shell (Toolbelt)\" feature (upgrade, 2 scraps); both spend from your Toolbelt pool — tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[M] Passive: Slowed you apply lasts +1 turn.</em></p>",
